WEBVTT

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:33.260
<b>Episode 10 
To the Princess's Side</b>

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:33.050
I'll save both Miyu and the world!

00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:44.980
Saying we have to choose 
is flawed from the start!

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:47.570
Nonsense.

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:49.970
It's the Holy Grail, right?

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:53.700
We entrust humanity's wishes and 
hopes to the Holy Grail, right?

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:56.050
So why?

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:58.760
Why aren't we wishing for 
everyone to be happy?!

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:03.060
Illya-sama!

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:05.600
What the heck?

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:07.720
Do you have a plan when you say that?

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:10.530
I don't know how to make it happen.

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:12.950
But... But...

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:17.070
But...

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.790
Maybe that kind of dream-like wish

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:23.130
is exactly what we should 
entrust to the Holy Grail, right?

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:29.130
Yeah!

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:36.550
That voice!

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:38.440
Darius-sama...

00:02:38.990 --> 00:02:41.820
What splendid, biting words, Illyasviel.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:45.810
How arrogant, how sentimental, how illogical.

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:48.520
And yet they strike the heart...

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.440
That's as you should be.

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:53.400
We need you to continue trying to save Miyu.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:58.610
Miyu-oneechan, you're crying?

00:02:58.610 --> 00:02:59.740
Are you sad?

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:03.980
Tears aren't

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:07.900
shed only when you're sad.

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:14.630
I thought my fate was to die as the Holy Grail.

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:17.270
I had given up, thinking I couldn't escape it.

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:19.210
But...

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:20.470
Miyu!

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:23.380
Will you cling to such fragile hope,

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:27.430
such uncertain idealism that could 
disappear when you try to seize it?

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:29.730
I won't

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:33.830
run away into despair anymore!

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:41.240
How touching!

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:43.480
Did you hear that, Illyasviel?

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:47.870
Your willpower has given our princess hope!

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:51.120
I want you to fight with all your power.

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:53.870
Try and steal Miyu from me!

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:57.340
Hope is the very worst poison.

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:58.720
You don't need to tell us that!

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:01.350
Shave your beard, old man. 
We're coming for you.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:05.770
After we defeat her, you're next.

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:11.170
Illya, release your Install.

00:04:11.170 --> 00:04:13.200
You're more effective in normal mode.

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:14.980
Okay.

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:17.890
Is this all right?

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:20.210
Whoa! What's with that outfit?!

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:23.070
Is that how you look when you have Sapphire?

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:25.700
Isn't that a little too lewd?

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:29.660
Your belly button, the skirt... What's up with this?!

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:29.660
Hey, Kuro...

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:31.390
This isn't the time.

00:04:31.390 --> 00:04:34.140
I'd love to wear it sometime!

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:36.370
Kuro?

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:37.150
Shh!

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:38.820
Listen, I'll...

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:41.960
Huh?

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:43.270
Now, then...

00:04:43.270 --> 00:04:45.430
Sapphire, you can talk, right?

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:49.300
Yes. I'll outline our situation.

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:51.540
The enemy specializes in 
displacement thaumaturgy.

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:55.240
Rin-sama and Luvia-sama have 
had their minds displaced,

00:04:55.240 --> 00:04:58.040
but they'll return to normal if you 
strike the seal on their chest.

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:01.480
H-Hey, Kuro, what are you...

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:03.940
What... No.

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:06.710
Okay, we've got the bare minimum of information.

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:08.880
First, we need to rescue our pair of idiots.

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:09.950
The best timing is...

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:11.370
Who are you talking to?

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:12.240
...up to you.

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:13.550
Roger.

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:25.340
Gil-kun and Bazett-san? 
Where did you come from?

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:27.090
That cloth...

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:30.130
You shouldn't store it in the Gate of Babylon.

00:05:30.130 --> 00:05:34.870
I'm the one with ownership over it, 
so I can draw it out, too...

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:37.390
Hades's Cap of Invisibility.

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:40.810
Whoa.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:43.960
I-I'm back in my body?

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:47.200
What is with this topless outfit?!

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:50.730
Illya-san! I was worried about you!

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:51.580
Ruby!

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:56.000
You infiltrated with three from 
the start, but kept two hidden?

00:05:56.000 --> 00:06:00.560
One of us ran too far ahead, 
so we barely made it in time.

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:02.340
Sorry about that.

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:03.900
I won't let you shoot.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:07.220
Hey, hey! I'm not following what's going on!

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:09.280
Someone give me an explanation!

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:12.180
Also, lend me an overcoat, please!

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:18.480
You never do learn.

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:22.320
This isn't the time to collect change.

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:25.190
We managed to rescue Rin and 
Luvia, so your next job is...

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:28.480
Yeah, yeah. You're a slave driver.

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:33.600
Then I'll just block it.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:36.790
Sorry, Granny.

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:38.040
I don't have time...

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:41.420
<i>She's aiming above me?</i>

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:42.840
...for you!

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:54.280
This is why I hate children.

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:58.770
Every single one of you ignores the program!

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:08.260
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:07:08.970 --> 00:07:10.510
I'm here to rescue you.

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:18.650
Miyu!

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:20.500
Illya...

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:23.240
I won't let you!

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:33.260
Don't worry, Miyu.

00:07:33.630 --> 00:07:34.720
I'm...

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.470
coming to get you now!

00:07:37.380 --> 00:07:39.060
<i>Install!</i>

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:40.860
You never learn!

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:43.810
<i>Crown Undertaker.</i>

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:45.640
Illya!

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:48.110
Here's an extra for you...

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:50.060
<i>Ninth Prayer.</i>

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:54.030
Illya!

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:10.550
Something like that won't work!

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:13.180
<i>There's one more Card I received</i>

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:14.680
<i>from Kuro.</i>

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:16.680
<i>Include!</i>

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:19.600
<i>Rule Breaker!</i>

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:24.580
<i>This is...</i>

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:28.440
Darius-sama!

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:29.720
All right!

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:32.470
That destroys all thaumaturgy.

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:35.670
If that man is the one conducting 
this Holy Grail War,

00:08:35.670 --> 00:08:37.910
it may be that the entire ceremony...

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.650
What is this?

00:08:53.690 --> 00:08:55.630
P-Papa?

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:58.600
How... dare you?

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:04.520
Huh?

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:06.400
Wh-What?

00:09:07.390 --> 00:09:08.900
What's happening?

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:13.650
What the hell have you done?!

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:15.820
Beatrice?

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:17.150
Tsk.

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:20.010
So what's going on with him?

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:24.390
Protect Darius-sama. 
That is all you need to do.

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:25.790
What have you been doing?

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:28.070
I'd just finished enjoying myself.

00:09:28.070 --> 00:09:29.770
Don't make me go into detail.

00:09:29.770 --> 00:09:32.550
What's going on here?

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:36.050
Whatever. You're up against 
both of us now.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.550
No matter what you try on your own,

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:40.510
you'll never reach anyone again.

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:44.270
Not this man, nor your caged little birdie.

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:47.600
I'm not on my own.

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:49.770
And besides, Miyu...

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:51.270
has her own wings!

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:53.780
Miyu-sama!

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:55.110
Sapphire!

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:01.780
I finally got to see you again.

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:07.260
Master!

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:28.970
Pretty...

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:36.360
The castle's turning into a mountain?

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:38.030
No, it's returning to one?

00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:41.620
So Darius displaced this 
mountain with his castle?

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:43.910
He used thaumaturgy on such a grand scale...

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.160
And by himself?

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:47.270
<i>I have a bad feeling about this.</i>

00:10:47.920 --> 00:10:50.540
<i>We don't have time to waste 
being confused, Illya!</i>

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:55.380
Miyu!

00:10:56.620 --> 00:10:57.730
Illya...

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:01.550
Flirting in the damn air...

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:03.800
Are you dragonflies or what?!

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:13.360
Farewell, Ainsworth.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:17.780
Miyu-oneechan, are you leaving us?

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:19.080
Erica...

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:20.300
Erica-chan...

00:11:22.630 --> 00:11:27.390
Listen, I don't want to sacrifice anyone.

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:29.720
If there's a way to save everyone,

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:32.830
no matter how slim the chance may be,

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:35.290
I want to pursue it.

00:11:37.820 --> 00:11:39.670
That's so damn stupid!

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:44.470
Do you seriously believe that 
feather-brained crap, Miyu-san?!

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:47.930
I do believe it. Because Illya's my friend.

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:52.100
Your heads are screwed up.

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:53.600
Your friend...

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:55.610
What about me?

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:59.050
I'm your friend too, aren't I, Miyu-oneechan?

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:00.860
Erica...

00:12:03.210 --> 00:12:07.490
<i>That girl only knows the world the 
Ainsworths have shown her.</i>

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:10.790
<i>She means neither harm nor good, but...</i>

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:12.600
You're...

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:14.550
not my friend.

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:23.140
I see...

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:24.890
I'm not.

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:27.590
I'm just...

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:30.370
Have you forgotten, Miyu-sama?

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:33.810
We still hold the reins to your brother's life.

00:12:34.470 --> 00:12:36.520
Stop! Not Onii-chan!

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:37.770
What a shame.

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:39.270
You haven't noticed, then?

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:45.430
We haven't seen the most
unpredictable one of us in a while.

00:12:55.090 --> 00:12:56.950
Wh-Who's there?

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:01.480
Wake up.

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:04.460
Time for you to break out, Onii-chan.

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:07.370
You don't need to worry, Miyu.

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:08.550
By now, he's already...

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:12.460
What's that?

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:23.490
Darius-sama?

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:59.970
Even laughing is tiresome.

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:05.900
This isn't funny...

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:08.170
This isn't funny at all.

00:14:08.770 --> 00:14:11.350
This is absolutely trifling.

00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:15.690
A mere vessel shouldn't speak of the future.

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:21.150
Your words, your will, your emotions

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:23.660
are all just materials.

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:28.510
It's futile.

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:35.430
You can't overturn my myth.

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:37.480
Wh-What is that?

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:39.470
How would I know?

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:40.700
I don't know.

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:43.440
I don't know, but that's definitely...

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:45.820
Beyond the power of any human.

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:04.390
What is that?

00:15:04.390 --> 00:15:05.710
Where did it come from?

00:15:06.490 --> 00:15:09.450
It can't be. It was here the whole time?

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:11.390
Above the castle?

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:14.770
Miyu, what's that? What's going on?

00:15:14.770 --> 00:15:17.340
Who in the world is Darius?

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:20.610
That's not Darius.

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:21.400
Huh?

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:23.950
Darius is long dead.

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:26.990
The man standing there is a counterfeiter

00:15:26.990 --> 00:15:29.480
who hid Darius's death and clung to his ghost.

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:31.280
He is

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:34.370
Julian Ainsworth,

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:37.220
Darius Ainsworth's son.

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:40.260
Son? Julian?

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:44.290
<i>Huh? That name and face...</i>

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:45.640
<i>Where have I...</i>

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:48.170
Quit your prattle.

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:50.840
I am Darius.

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:57.540
Illyasviel, I'll forgive you.

00:15:57.540 --> 00:16:00.760
For giving Miyu unnecessary 
knowledge and power...

00:16:00.760 --> 00:16:03.600
For destroying my father's 
conceptual displacement.

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:05.440
Those are trivial matters.

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:06.940
But remember this.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:09.940
If you try to destroy my myth...

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:13.530
If you try to overturn the 
conclusion I've established...

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:15.570
I'll erase you myself!

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:18.200
No way! The Card...

00:16:22.270 --> 00:16:24.080
I figured it wouldn't,

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:26.380
but it didn't even budge, huh?

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:27.510
Kuro!

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:29.470
Kuro...

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:32.040
It's been a while, Miyu.

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:34.290
I'd love to hug you, too,

00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:36.510
but I don't think we have the time.

00:16:37.860 --> 00:16:39.180
Onii-chan...

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:40.370
What?

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:41.990
Miyu-oneechan said

00:16:43.010 --> 00:16:45.690
that I'm not her friend...

00:16:47.660 --> 00:16:48.690
Why not?

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:51.000
I was always nice to her.

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:53.890
She even pets my head...

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:57.450
Huh? That's obvious!

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:00.410
You were no more than someone to talk to.

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:02.710
From Miyu's perspective, we're all

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:05.180
her enemies, you know!

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:09.500
Who gave you permission to speak?

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:15.880
You're seizing my heart?

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:20.410
Onii-chan?

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:21.810
That's right.

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:25.760
I am your only ally, your only family.

00:17:26.260 --> 00:17:28.160
You have no one else left.

00:17:28.910 --> 00:17:31.230
People are born to perish.

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:33.410
Our world is already broken.

00:17:33.410 --> 00:17:35.740
Our future is already at a dead end.

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:37.450
All the more reason

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:39.630
I will protect it.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:43.660
You and I will realize the Ainsworth ambition!

00:17:45.180 --> 00:17:46.330
Got it?

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:53.670
I'm...

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:57.000
I'm not sad at all!

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:59.560
After all, I have you, Onii-chan.

00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:01.200
I'll do my best.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:03.480
Onii-chan, I'll...

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:07.850
believe in you—

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:16.600
Erica?

00:18:23.510 --> 00:18:25.730
I'll advance the myth by another passage.

00:18:25.730 --> 00:18:28.000
If you're running, then have it your way, Miyu.

00:18:28.230 --> 00:18:33.320
However, the darkness of the Ainsworths 
will cover this Earth to its core.

00:18:38.100 --> 00:18:39.040
Huh?

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:39.800
That muck

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:41.330
is taking human shape?

00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:43.930
No way.

00:18:46.380 --> 00:18:48.220
Every one of those

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:50.600
is a Heroic Spirit?

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:52.840
What?

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:53.940
You're kidding!

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:55.110
Get back!

00:18:57.820 --> 00:18:58.830
Why, you...

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:03.580
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:07.040
<i>None of these are small fry!</i>

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:09.040
<i>Full Arc, Schneiden!</i>

00:19:12.840 --> 00:19:14.330
It's not working!

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:16.420
What in the world are these things?

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:19.450
Bazett!

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:20.630
Please run!

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:23.390
Just buying time is difficult.

00:19:27.320 --> 00:19:30.350
Holy Grail...

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:36.280
Holy Grail... Holy Grail... Holy Grail...

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:46.200
Holy Grail... Holy Grail... Holy Grail...

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:54.420
Those Heroic Spirits of the muck are 
the dead who failed to win the Grail.

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:57.760
They are beasts whose only
motive is to seek the Grail.

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:01.240
They will multiply until they manage to find it,

00:20:01.240 --> 00:20:03.820
and they will bury this planet in despair.

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:05.820
Do you understand?

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:07.810
If you want to stop this disaster,

00:20:08.490 --> 00:20:09.990
take my hand

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:12.230
of your own free will.

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:30.500
You mustn't, Miyu-sama.

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:33.920
If you go back to him now, 
it will all have been for naught!

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:37.040
Miyu-sama!

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:44.430
You can't take his hand.

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:47.860
Illyasviel!

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:49.880
Illya?

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:57.610
Pointless.

00:20:57.610 --> 00:21:01.740
Must you lose everything you cling to 
before you'll understand?!

00:21:16.050 --> 00:21:17.300
That's right.

00:21:18.560 --> 00:21:23.120
Miyu, you don't need to be bound 
by that man any longer.

00:21:24.520 --> 00:21:27.720
N-No way. Why are you...

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:28.890
What's happening?

00:21:29.730 --> 00:21:30.680
It can't be.

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:33.050
I heard what's going on.

00:21:34.440 --> 00:21:35.690
Thank you.

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:37.870
For fighting for my little sister.

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:40.660
I'll take care of the rest.

00:21:41.130 --> 00:21:43.320
That's my job, as her big brother.

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:47.530
<i>Trace...</i>

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:50.410
<i>On.</i>

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:35.970
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:21.690 --> 00:23:26.750
It seems Miyu will never find 
happiness unless I defeat you.

00:23:26.750 --> 00:23:30.330
If you say you'll sacrifice one for the whole,

00:23:30.330 --> 00:23:32.650
I'll be the villain as often as it takes.

00:23:32.530 --> 00:25:00.000
<b>You Are Not Alone</b>

00:23:33.090 --> 00:23:35.920
I've made it to you, Julian!
